Spec: Independent secure stream integration

Purpose:
  Demonstrate usable SDK data transport and explicit owner setup without embedding gateway authority in applications.

Structure:
  ./SecureApp: Ordinary application consumer, HTTPS/WebSocket service and stream integration.
  ./OwnerHarness: Isolated owner provisioning and end-to-end acceptance driver.

Owns:
  ./verify.ps1
  ./README.md

Must:
  Use separate generated identities, private state and actual Agent/application processes.
  Verify unauthenticated and ungranted access rejection, file integrity, WebSocket, directional FIN and active revocation.
  Label loopback process tests accurately; do not claim physical-device, NAT or relay acceptance.
  Provide reproducible application setup and report remaining operational limitations.

Tasks:
  [x] #1 Verify isolated owner enrollment and two-Agent independent application traffic with scoped active revocation.
